{
    "title": "RAID: Shadow Legends",
    "description": "Summon over 800 legendary heroes from 15 factions to battle bosses like fearsome dragons and colossal demons. Explore dungeons, enjoy turn-based multiplayer action, and master tactics to free Teleria in this epic role-playing game!\r\n\r\nTactical battles await in this turn-based dark fantasy role-playing game, where you can summon hundreds of Champions from 15 playable factions.\r\n\r\nFight the forces of the dark lord Siroth with your legendary band of immortal warriors. Train them for battle, craft the perfect strategy, and assemble the greatest raiding party ever seen.\r\n\r\nEpic clashes await in online modes like the multiplayer Arena, where you can put your team of Champions against others in strategic RPG battles. Experiment with over 1+ million possible Champion builds, craft the ultimate team and their battle tactics, and be the best!\r\n\r\nWith over 5 years of free content updates and a community that grows bigger every day, join millions of players in the war to liberate Teleria from Siroth and his legions. Become a hero of legend!\r\n\r\n| Enjoy deep RPG features |\r\n\r\nCollect powerful Champions\r\nSummon 800+ warriors from 15 factions in this tactical role-playing game. Call upon orcs, knights, elves, and more dark fantasy creatures to defeat any threat that stands in your way.\r\n\r\nStrategic turn-based RPG gameplay\r\nEquip your Champions with amazing artifacts to aid them in battle. Rank them up to unleash devastating skills, AOE attacks, magic powers and more as you lead them in combat.\r\n\r\nFight epic boss battles\r\nDo you dare take on the Magma Dragon, the Fire Knight, or the Ice Golem? Vanquish challenging bosses in dangerous dungeons for loot, XP, and special Champion drops. Then, in classic turn-based RPG style, fight them again for more powerful gear!\r\n\r\nFeel the visceral 3D artwork\r\nBeautiful, fully-rendered 3D heroes offer stunning detail down to the cracks in their armor. Marvel at a vivid fantasy world with thousands of unique skill and attack animations.\r\n\r\nJoin forces with your Clan\r\nTeam up with fellow players and take on challenges like the fearsome Demon Lord with Clans! Battle other Clans in special tournaments and show them that they\u2019re out of your league.\r\n\r\nFace the multiplayer PvP Arena\r\nGo head-to-head with other players in fierce turn-based combat to unlock special gear. Rise through the ranks and become an Arena legend.\r\n\r\nDevelop and manage your Bastion\r\nUpgrade your own personal fortress to manage your Shards and ready your Champions for dungeon runs, multiplayer arena combat, and the story campaign.\r\n\r\nClear our massive PvE Campaign map\r\nExperience epic dark fantasy done right through 12 spectacular RPG locations spread over a sprawling, fully-voiced story campaign. Heed your heroic duty and conquer the forces of Darkness.\r\n\r\nDive into a deep fantasy world\r\nLearn about Teleria\u2019s heroes and villains with our growing collection of Champion bios. Then, check out our animated limited series, RAID: Call of the Arbiter, on YouTube!\r\n\r\nPlease note:\r\nItems are available for purchase in this fantasy MMO role-playing game. Some paid items may not be refundable depending on the type of item.\r\n\r\nOptional Access to Photos and Videos:\r\nUsed for sharing screenshots for troubleshooting (e.g., technical support). You can continue using the service without granting this access.\r\n\r\nRAID Official Website: https://plarium.com/\r\nRAID Support: raid.support@plarium.com\r\nOur RPG Community: https://plarium.com/forum/en/raid-shadow-legends/\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://plarium.com/en/legal/privacy-and-cookie-policy/\r\nTerms of Use: https://plarium.com/en/legal/terms-of-use/\r\nCCPA Employee and Applicant Notice: https://plarium.com/en/legal/ccpa/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Summon over 800 legendary heroes from 15 factions to battle bosses like fearsome dragons and colossal demons. Explore dungeons, enjoy turn-based multiplayer action, and master tactics to free Teleria in this epic role-playing game!<br><br>Tactical battles await in this turn-based dark fantasy role-playing game, where you can summon hundreds of Champions from 15 playable factions.<br><br>Fight the forces of the dark lord Siroth with your legendary band of immortal warriors. Train them for battle, craft the perfect strategy, and assemble the greatest raiding party ever seen.<br><br>Epic clashes await in online modes like the multiplayer Arena, where you can put your team of Champions against others in strategic RPG battles. Experiment with over 1+ million possible Champion builds, craft the ultimate team and their battle tactics, and be the best!<br><br>With over 5 years of free content updates and a community that grows bigger every day, join millions of players in the war to liberate Teleria from Siroth and his legions. Become a hero of legend!<br><br>| Enjoy deep RPG features |<br><br>Collect powerful Champions<br>Summon 800+ warriors from 15 factions in this tactical role-playing game. Call upon orcs, knights, elves, and more dark fantasy creatures to defeat any threat that stands in your way.<br><br>Strategic turn-based RPG gameplay<br>Equip your Champions with amazing artifacts to aid them in battle. Rank them up to unleash devastating skills, AOE attacks, magic powers and more as you lead them in combat.<br><br>Fight epic boss battles<br>Do you dare take on the Magma Dragon, the Fire Knight, or the Ice Golem? Vanquish challenging bosses in dangerous dungeons for loot, XP, and special Champion drops. Then, in classic turn-based RPG style, fight them again for more powerful gear!<br><br>Feel the visceral 3D artwork<br>Beautiful, fully-rendered 3D heroes offer stunning detail down to the cracks in their armor. Marvel at a vivid fantasy world with thousands of unique skill and attack animations.<br><br>Join forces with your Clan<br>Team up with fellow players and take on challenges like the fearsome Demon Lord with Clans! Battle other Clans in special tournaments and show them that they\u2019re out of your league.<br><br>Face the multiplayer PvP Arena<br>Go head-to-head with other players in fierce turn-based combat to unlock special gear. Rise through the ranks and become an Arena legend.<br><br>Develop and manage your Bastion<br>Upgrade your own personal fortress to manage your Shards and ready your Champions for dungeon runs, multiplayer arena combat, and the story campaign.<br><br>Clear our massive PvE Campaign map<br>Experience epic dark fantasy done right through 12 spectacular RPG locations spread over a sprawling, fully-voiced story campaign. Heed your heroic duty and conquer the forces of Darkness.<br><br>Dive into a deep fantasy world<br>Learn about Teleria\u2019s heroes and villains with our growing collection of Champion bios. Then, check out our animated limited series, RAID: Call of the Arbiter, on YouTube!<br><br>Please note:<br>Items are available for purchase in this fantasy MMO role-playing game. Some paid items may not be refundable depending on the type of item.<br><br>Optional Access to Photos and Videos:<br>Used for sharing screenshots for troubleshooting (e.g., technical support). You can continue using the service without granting this access.<br><br>RAID Official Website: https://plarium.com/<br>RAID Support: raid.support@plarium.com<br>Our RPG Community: https://plarium.com/forum/en/raid-shadow-legends/<br>Privacy Policy: https://plarium.com/en/legal/privacy-and-cookie-policy/<br>Terms of Use: https://plarium.com/en/legal/terms-of-use/<br>CCPA Employee and Applicant Notice: https://plarium.com/en/legal/ccpa/",
